&lt;li&gt;Precast Weapon spells
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;76975&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Splinter Weapon&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;76739&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Nightmare Weapon&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ul&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use all your off-hand sword skills (Activates Claw Relic)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;71813&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Hungering Maelstrom → &lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;skills&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;72068&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Gormandize&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
