&lt;h1 id=&quot;changes&quot;&gt;Changes&lt;&#x2F;h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;content&#x2F;builds&#x2F;quickness-power-harbinger.md was changed:&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spiteful Talisman: This trait no longer reduces the cooldowns of axe and focus skills. This trait now increases base strike damage and is further increased against boonless foes.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deathly Haste: This trait has been reworked. Grant boons to nearby allies when you enter Harbinger Shroud and when you use Dark Barrage.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ul&gt;
